{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0067"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge society/politics","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/society__politics.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",120],["-","countries"],["+","countries,"],["=",1],["+","and one German parody of the genre, "],["=",764],["+","Not every founder means it seriously. In August 2004 editors of the Frankfurt satirical magazine Titanic, led by its former editor-in-chief Martin Sonneborn, founded Die PARTEI, the \"Party for Labour, Rule of Law, Animal Protection, Promotion of Elites and Grassroots Democratic Initiative\". Conceived as a joke on exactly this kind of party, it won a seat in the European Parliament in 2014, when German European elections had no threshold, and Sonneborn has sat there ever since.\n\n"],["=",135],["+","\n| Die PARTEI | Titanic editors around Martin Sonneborn | Germany | 2004 |"]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",118],["+","und eine deutsche Parodie des Genres "],["=",724],["+","Nicht jeder Gründer meint es ernst. Im August 2004 gründeten Redakteure der Frankfurter Satirezeitschrift Titanic um ihren früheren Chefredakteur Martin Sonneborn Die PARTEI, die „Partei für Arbeit, Rechtsstaat, Tierschutz, Elitenförderung und basisdemokratische Initiative“. Als Witz über genau diese Art von Partei gedacht, gewann sie 2014, als es bei der Europawahl in Deutschland keine Sperrklausel gab, einen Sitz im Europäischen Parlament, und Sonneborn sitzt seitdem dort.\n\n"],["=",131],["+","\n| Die PARTEI | Titanic-Redakteure um Martin Sonneborn | Deutschland | 2004 |"]]}]},
